cause he's evil now  as nimoy's squadron of unearthly  creatures ripped through the terrified  london streets  hellboy ultimately comes to his senses  and overpowers them away he decapitates  her with excalibur sending her still  screaming head back into the fiery  fathoms of hell  in the film's final set piece hellboy  finds himself on a dangerous mission in  siberia with two trusty cohorts from the  bprd  scrappy spirit medium alice monahan  played by sasha lane  and moody ben daimio played by daniel  day kim  ben is a down low wear jaguar whose  theoretically british accent also has a  penchant for shape-shifting  after dispatching the members of a  secret cabal called the atlantis society  the trio notice a large fish tank  suddenly webbed fingers poke out from  the murky water and touch the glass  surface  if you've ever read the comics or seen  the guillermo del toro films the name  abe sapien will surely mean something to  you although he may be half man and half  amphibian  the character is entirely badass  portrayed by doug jones in the del toro  films abe sapien was once a man named  langdon everett who dabbled in the  occult and paid the ultimate price  he became a half man and half amphibian  monstrosity  those are abe's webbed fingers clearly  clamoring for a sequel  remind me why i keep doing this hellboy  throws not one  but two scenes in the end credits in the  mid-credits scene we find hellboy  mourning the recent death of professor  trevor broome  suddenly the specter of a certain  lobster johnson appears portrayed by  actor thomas hayden church  the ghostly figure wastes no time  telling hellboy evil  is coming johnson also appears in an  earlier flashback making mincemeat out  of a slew of nazi occultists  so who is this guy long story short he's  a beloved character in the hellboy  universe a vigilante who plays by his  own rules  as you just saw johnson is fond of  searing his signature lobster claw  symbol into the foreheads of his enemies  what's not to like about that during his  quest to find nimoue the blood queen  hellboy pays a visit to baba yaga  haggard witch who exists in some far-off  dimension  baba yaga offers hellboy some clues  regarding nimawe's whereabouts  but this intel comes at a price he must  give her one of his eyeballs  he agrees but manages to escape baba  yaga with both eyeballs intact but in a  post-credits scene baba yaga convinces  an unseen accomplice to murder hellboy  at his earliest convenience  and hand over the hellish eyes she was  promised the los  angeles times seems to think she's  talking to kosha the deathless  a seemingly immortal assassin who  appears in the darkness falls graphic  novel  this theory gels with the fact that baba  yaga assures her henchman she'll  mercifully end his life if he brings her  hellboy's eye  after surviving a movie full of so much  sensory overload  you may be willing to volunteer both of  your own  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

